     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_5689063520297045994__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Ornella,<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">IN warpRefMesh, you must give it the name of the mesh Object. For your example that is\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">‘specimen1PLY’.  Instead you have given it the name of the PLY file “specimen1.ply”.  That is just a text file and\r\n is not in the proper format.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Instead try:\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">warpRefMesh“specimen1PLY, specimen1, average, color=NULL)<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485809012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22fbpXgxuZBEYKRq4ijGqm\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></span><span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<span></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Ornella<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, March 2, 2018 4:15 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Error when running warpRefMesh - &quot;mesh.coord&quot; not a xyz matrix<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">Hello everyone,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">I’m running into an issue when I’m trying to use the function “warpRefMesh”.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">I started with the following:</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\"> </span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">specimen1PLY &lt;- read.ply(&quot;specimen1.ply&quot;, ShowSpecimen=TRUE)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> ### works</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">specimen1 &lt;- readmulti.nts(&quot;specimen1.txt&quot;)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">### works, <b>mesh.coord</b></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">averagemesh &lt;- warpRefMesh(“specimen1.ply”, specimen1, average, color=NULL)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> # this command\r\n does not work.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> I get the following message:\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">“Error in warpRefMesh(&quot;specimen1PLY.ply&quot;, specimen1,  :\r\n</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">  File is not a mesh3d object or xyz matrix”</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">For\r\n<b>average</b>, I followed the Geomorph guide and used the following:</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">average &lt;-mshape(Y$coords)\r\n</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"># ref</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:red\">findMeanSpec(Y$coords)</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">I think that my “mesh.coord&quot; and &quot;ref” are x, y, z matrices but maybe they are not and I’m missing something. Originally my data is a morphologika\r\n file so I saved the <b>specimen1</b> as a separate nts. file but maybe I didn’t formatted properly. Since it opens, I don’t understand where is the error.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Just to make sure for the\r\n<span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">“mesh.coord”, the data should be the raw data points for\r\n<b>specimen1 </b>but for the “ref”, they are the Procrustes coordinates for <b>specimen1</b>, is this correct?</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">Any ideas to resolve this issue? Sorry, I’m new to R so maybe I’m missing something fundamental.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"color:black\">Thanks in advance!</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ngeomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485809012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02JEV8Pnb1ak6Ta7t-IqT4\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/a7fb0708-632b-4762-8e32-e3c9f546f236%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/a7fb0708-632b-4762-8e32-e3c9f546f236%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485809012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zdMlS0rCAkaGBLPGvjwS-\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/a7fb0708-632b-4762-8e32-e3c9f546f236%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485809012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KrH9kpKwo29oNGJaOeueV\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
